  "description": "**This is the story of a world where if you're a virgin until you're 30, you become a real wizard.**\n\nA world where the magical phenomenon 'explosion of sexual desire' and the 'wizards' who fight against it coexist. Hae-Sung, who has lived as a virgin until his 30s due to erectile dysfunction, accidentally finds out that he has great talent as a wizard, and becomes a wizard duo with Do-Hyun, whom he thought was his one-night stand partner... Wait a minute. My weapon is my partner's precious \"XX\"?\n\n*\"I don't need this kind of talent! I don't want to do it~!!\"*\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
